# Launch day 🚀

  We ❤️ shipping, and the tests are green ✅.

  - Coffee ☕ first
  - Then 🎉 when it works

  Unknown codes stay as written:
  :not_a_real_code:. GitHub's own image emoji
  are not standard emoji either, so :octocat:
  stays as text.

  Code is left alone: `:rocket:` in a span,
  and in a block:

    echo ":rocket:"

  ╭──────┬───────┬────────────╮
  │ Mood │ Emoji │ Note       │
  ├──────┼───────┼────────────┤
  │ Love │  ❤️   │ text after │
  │ Fire │  🔥   │ text after │
  │ Star │  ⭐   │ text after │
  ╰──────┴───────┴────────────╯
